4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I0WnNU_Gm1UQ7kNvwGUnDZs&_nc_oc=AdoGwDgIfgMWENhi9WAOWj68BbdcYaQExT-BUD_mB_l8Q--bQXFQwyBywRl3WiK3vhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyLLQq25YbmArv6buFTH89sOCuPLH8lfjow9CHmnm-uEQ&oe=69C28BD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t757DALxpV0Q7kNvwG2ieRL&_nc_oc=Adp-w4NadEygZ85cEObDnv3bH07j1MH2Km_8u89ZABywNfodzW3y6BeUD7mo8NPLpoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxFOPv7ky6uqTbirGmc5vhtvyjcWQWlJKPBC4jYs2Gm8g&oe=69C290B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uudlYoCH4ZoQ7kNvwF79RKm&_nc_oc=AdpiFoK1crvNm4xyyGyHGj5xoFF2Il0KvlL6xsZtmUtW97zYfS_cHan8cKKKrAlb8Tg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfztIQM55H2LIj7U3s6hO60EhzqUJabIeTuwOUX8lzhCEA&oe=69C29E55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p